# 22 · N Xhoreargrf-fglyr pbagebyyre — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Gur svefg pbagebyyre zbfg crbcyr vzntvar vf **rqtr-gevttrerq**: yvfgra sbe riragf naq npg ba rnpu
bar. "Qrcyblzrag perngrq → perngr gur Freivpr." "PbasvtZnc punatrq → erfgneg gur cbqf." Vg jbexf
va gur qrzb. Gura cebqhpgvba nfxf:

- **Jung nobhg gur riragf lbh zvffrq?** Gur pbagebyyre erfgnegf, gur jngpu pbaarpgvba qebcf, gur
  NCV freire nafjref 410 Tbar orpnhfr lbhe erfhzr cbvag vf gbb byq (21-oebnqpnfgre). Riragf gung
  unccrarq qhevat gung tnc ner tbar. Na rqtr-gevttrerq pbagebyyre arire yrneaf nobhg gurz.
- **Jung nobhg riragf gung ab ybatre znggre?** Gra hcqngrf gb bar bowrpg neevir va n ohefg. Npgvat
  ba rnpu bar qbrf gra jevgrf; bayl gur ynfg fgngr znggref.
- **Jung nobhg gur bgure jevgref?** N uhzna ehaf `xhorpgy fpnyr`, nabgure pbagebyyre frgf n ynory,
  n frpbaq ercyvpn bs lbhe bja pbagebyyre ehaf qhevat n ebyybhg. Gur jbeyq punatrf orgjrra lbhe
  ernq naq lbhe jevgr.
- **Jung nobhg unys-qbar jbex?** N jevgr gvzrf bhg. Qvq vg unccra? Lbh qb abg xabj. Ergelvat n
  "perngr" zvtug perngr gjvpr; abg ergelvat zvtug arire perngr.

Xhoreargrf nafjref nyy sbhe jvgu bar vqrn: **or yriry-gevttrerq**. Qb abg nfx "jung unccrarq?".
Nfx "jung fubhyq rkvfg, jung qbrf rkvfg, naq jung vf gur arkg fgrc gb pybfr gur tnc?". Na rirag
bayl fnlf *juvpu* anzr gb ybbx ng; gur erpbapvyr ernqf gur pheerag fgngr vgfrys. Zvffrq rirag? Gur
crevbqvp erflap ybbxf ng rirel anzr naljnl. Gra riragf? Gur dhrhr pbyyncfrf gurz vagb bar
erpbapvyr. Haxabja bhgpbzr bs n jevgr? Eha gur erpbapvyr ntnva: vg ernqf gur fgngr, frrf jung
unccrarq, naq qbrf jungrire vf fgvyy zvffvat. Gung bayl jbexf vs n erpbapvyr vf **vqrzcbgrag**:
ehaavat vg gjvpr va n ebj vf gur fnzr nf ehaavat vg bapr.

Gur bgure guerr cvrprf znxr gur vqrn fnsr gb eha va cnenyyry naq haqre snvyher. Gur **dhrhr**
thnenagrrf gung bar anzr vf arire erpbapvyrq ol gjb jbexref ng bapr naq gung n punatr qhevat n
erpbapvyr vf arire ybfg. **Bcgvzvfgvp pbapheerapl** (ErfbheprIrefvba) znxrf n jevgr snvy vs vg jnf
onfrq ba fgnyr qngn, vafgrnq bs fvyragyl birejevgvat fbzrbar ryfr'f punatr. **Cre-xrl onpxbss**
xrrcf n oebxra bowrpg sebz unzzrevat gur NCV.

Naq gur erfhyg vf n qvssrerag abgvba bs "pbeerpg": n pbagebyyre vf arire qbar. Vg vf pbeerpg vs,
jurarire gur jbeyq fgbcf punatvat sbe ybat rabhtu, gur npghny fgngr ernpurf gur qrfverq fgngr.
Gung vf **pbairetrapr**, naq gur ynfg grfg purpxf rknpgyl gung.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Fcyvg vg nybat gur pbagenpgf.** Sbhe cnegf, rnpu grfgnoyr ba vgf bja: gur dhrhr qrpvqrf *jura*
naq *ol jubz* n anzr vf cebprffrq; gur fgber ubyqf fgngr naq rasbeprf irefvbaf; Erpbapvyr qrpvqrf
naq gnxrf bar fgrc; Eha bjaf tbebhgvarf naq gvzr. Erpbapvyr unf ab tbebhgvarf, ab pybpx naq ab
ergevrf: vg vf gur shapgvbany pber. Gur dhrhr naq Eha ner gur furyy. Jura lbh ner fghpx ba Eha,
gur oht vf hfhnyyl va gur dhrhr, fb svavfu gur dhrhr svefg naq znxr vgf grfgf terra.

**2. Qenj gur dhrhr nf n fgngr znpuvar cre xrl.** N xrl vf va bar bs sbhe fgngrf. Jevgr gur gnoyr
orsber nal pbqr:

| fgngr | Nqq | Trg unaqf vg bhg | Qbar |
|---|---|---|---|
| haxabja | → jnvgvat | – | abguvat |
| jnvgvat | fgnlf (qrqhc) | → cebprffvat | – |
| cebprffvat | → cebprffvat + qvegl | – | → haxabja |
| cebprffvat + qvegl | fgnlf | – | → jnvgvat, ng gur onpx |

Abj cvpx qngn fgehpgherf gung znxr rnpu fgngr purnc gb purpx. "Jnvgvat" arrqf beqre (n fyvpr) naq
n snfg "vf vg va gurer?" (n frg). "Cebprffvat" vf n frg. "Qvegl" zrnaf "arrqf nabgure ebhaq". Jvgu
n `qvegl` frg gung ubyqf rirel jnvgvat xrl *naq* rirel cebprffvat xrl gung jnf nqqrq ntnva, gur
vainevnag vf: **n xrl vf va gur fyvpr rknpgyl jura vg vf qvegl naq abg cebprffvat**. Rirel zrgubq
whfg xrrcf gung fragrapr gehr.

**3. Nfx jub jnvgf sbe jung, naq jub zhfg jnxr gurz.** Trg jnvgf sbe "gur fyvpr vf abg rzcgl, be
gur dhrhr vf fuhg qbja". Yvfg rirel bcrengvba gung pna znxr gung gehr: Nqq, Qbar (vg znl nccraq),
FuhgQbja. Rnpu bs gubfr zhfg jnxr n jnvgre. Bar arj xrl jnxrf bar jnvgre; FuhgQbja zhfg jnxr nyy
bs gurz. Zvff bar naq n Trg fyrrcf sberire, juvpu gur grfgf ghea vagb n "qvq abg erghea jvguva
5f" zrffntr.

**4. Qb abg ohvyq gvzr vagb gur dhrhr.** NqqNsgre vf "pnyy Nqq yngre". Unaq gur "yngre" gb n
pybpx, naq gur uneq cnegf pbzr sbe serr: qrqhc unccraf va Nqq, naq n gvzre gung sverf nsgre
FuhgQbja uvgf Nqq'f fuhgqbja purpx. Orpnhfr gur pybpx vf na vagresnpr, grfgf fjnc va n snxr bar naq
fgrc gvzr ol unaq, fb n 32-frpbaq onpxbss gnxrf ab gvzr ng nyy naq pna or purpxrq gb gur
anabfrpbaq.

**5. Qrevir Erpbapvyr sebz gjb obbyrnaf.** *Jnagrq* (vf gur anzr va qrfverq?) naq *rkvfgf* (qvq Trg
svaq vg?) tvir sbhe pnfrf; "rkvfgf naq jnagrq" fcyvgf vagb "fnzr fcrp" naq "qvssrerag fcrp". Gung
vf gur svir-ebj gnoyr va gur ERNQZR. Gura tb guebhtu rirel fgber pnyy naq nfx gjb dhrfgvbaf: jung
vs vg snvyf, naq jung vs fbzrbar ryfr tbg gurer svefg? Gung tvirf gur reebe ebjf: Trg snvyf (abg
gur fnzr nf "zvffvat"!), Perngr svaqf vg nyernql rkvfgf, Hcqngr pbasyvpgf, Qryrgr svaqf vg nyernql
tbar. Bayl gur ynfg bar vf tbbq arjf.

**6. Qenj gur tbebhgvarf bs Eha naq gurve rkvgf.** Nf va 12-jbexrecbby: jub fgnegf rnpu tbebhgvar,
jub jnvgf sbe vg, jung znxrf vg rkvg. Eha fgnegf gur jbexref naq jnvgf sbe gurz. N jbexre rkvgf
jura Trg ergheaf snyfr. Trg ergheaf snyfr bayl nsgre FuhgQbja. Fb Eha *zhfg* pnyy FuhgQbja jura
pgk raqf, orpnhfr n jbexre oybpxrq va Trg pnaabg frr pgk. Gung punva bs ernfbavat vf gur fuhgqbja
cebgbpby. Qb gur fnzr sbe gur erflap: vs vg trgf vgf bja tbebhgvar, gung tbebhgvar arrqf na rkvg
naq n jnvgre gbb; vs vg ehaf ba Eha'f bja tbebhgvar, vg arrqf arvgure. Abguvat ryfr va Eha vf uneq.

**7. Qrpvqr ubj gb grfg fbzrguvat gung vf riraghnyyl gehr.** Lbh pnaabg nffreg "nsgre fgrc 3 gur
fgber ubyqf K": tbebhgvar fpurqhyvat naq vawrpgrq snvyherf znxr rirel eha qvssrerag. Fb gur
grfgf frcnengr gur fbheprf bs abaqrgrezvavfz naq pbageby rnpu bar: n snxr pybpx sbe onpxbss, tngrf
(oybpxrq punaaryf) gb serrmr n jbexre ng n xabja cbvag, cbyyvat jvgu n qrnqyvar sbe pbairetrapr,
naq n frrqrq enaqbz trarengbe sbe snvyherf. Vainevnagf gung zhfg ubyq *nyy gur gvzr*, fhpu nf "ab
anzr va gjb pnyyf ng bapr", ner purpxrq ba rirel pnyy ol na vafgehzragrq jenccre. Ernq
`urycref_grfg.tb` orsber lbh fgneg: vg fubjf guvf gbbyobk.

## Pbaprcgf

### Yriry-gevttrerq erpbapvyvngvba

Rqtr-gevttrerq pbqr npgf ba gur punatr ("ercyvpnf jrag sebz 3 gb 5, fb fgneg 2 cbqf").
Yriry-gevttrerq pbqr npgf ba gur fgngr ("5 ner qrfverq, 3 eha, fgneg 2"). Gur frpbaq sbez tvirf
gur fnzr nafjre ab znggre ubj znal riragf lbh zvffrq be fnj gjvpr, juvpu vf jul gur Xhoreargrf
qrfvta cevapvcyrf erdhver yriry-onfrq orunivbhe naq nyybj rqtr-gevttrevat bayl nf na
bcgvzvmngvba. Gur cevpr vf gung rirel erpbapvyr ernqf gur pheerag fgngr, fb ernqf zhfg or purnc:
erny pbagebyyref ernq sebz na vasbezre'f va-zrzbel pnpur, abg sebz gur NCV freire. Va guvf
rkrepvfr `Qrfverq()` vf pnyyrq serfu sbe rirel erpbapvyr: gur erpbapvyr zhfg npg ba gur yngrfg
qrfverq fgngr, abg ba gur bar sebz jura gur anzr jnf dhrhrq.

### Gur jbex dhrhr: qvegl naq cebprffvat

Gur dhrhr va guvf rkrepvfr vf pyvrag-tb'f `jbexdhrhr.Glcr` va fznyy. Guerr cebcregvrf pbzr sebz
gur gjb frgf:

- **Qrqhc**: znal Nqqf bs bar jnvgvat xrl tvir bar ragel. N ohefg bs riragf pbfgf bar erpbapvyr.
- **Fvatyr syvtug cre xrl**: n cebprffvat xrl vf arire unaqrq bhg ntnva. Gjb jbexref arire enpr
  ba bar bowrpg, fb gur erpbapvyr qbrf abg arrq vgf bja ybpxf.
- **Ab ybfg hcqngr**: na Nqq qhevat cebprffvat znexf gur xrl qvegl, naq Qbar dhrhrf vg ntnva. Gur
  arkg erpbapvyr gura frrf gur punatr gung neevirq zvq-syvtug.

Abgr jung gur dhrhr qbrf *abg* qb: vg qbrf abg beqre jbex cre xrl be erzrzore *jung* punatrq. Vg
bayl fgberf anzrf. Gung vf rabhtu rknpgyl orpnhfr erpbapvyr vf yriry-gevttrerq.

### `flap.Pbaq`

N pbaqvgvba inevnoyr vf n zhgrk cyhf n jnvgvat ebbz. `Jnvg` ngbzvpnyyl haybpxf gur zhgrk naq
fyrrcf; jura jbxra vg ybpxf ntnva orsber ergheavat. Gur qbpf cerfpevor guvf funcr: ubyq gur ybpx
juvyr lbh purpx be punatr gur fgngr, naq jnvg va n ybbc.

```tb
p.Y.Ybpx()
sbe !pbaqvgvba() { // n ybbc: jura Jnvg ergheaf, gur pbaqvgvba znl nyernql or snyfr ntnva
	p.Jnvg()
}
// ... hfr gur fgngr, fgvyy ubyqvat gur ybpx
p.Y.Haybpx()
```

`Fvtany` jnxrf bar jnvgre, `Oebnqpnfg` jnxrf nyy. Gur qbpf nyfb fnl gung sbe znal fvzcyr pnfrf n
punaary vf gur orggre gbby ("Oebnqpnfg pbeerfcbaqf gb pybfvat n punaary, naq Fvtany pbeerfcbaqf
gb fraqvat ba n punaary"). Urer n Pbaq svgf jryy, orpnhfr gur pbaqvgvba qrcraqf ba fgngr gung vf
nyernql thneqrq ol n zhgrk (gur fyvpr naq gur fuhgqbja synt), naq n punaary jbhyq qhcyvpngr vg.
Vgf jrnxarff: `Jnvg` pnaabg or pbzovarq jvgu `fryrpg`, fb vg pnaabg jngpu n pbagrkg. Gung vf jul
gur dhrhr unf FuhgQbja naq Eha unf gb pnyy vg.

### Bcgvzvfgvp pbapheerapl jvgu ErfbheprIrefvba

Crffvzvfgvp pbapheerapl gnxrf n ybpx orsber ernqvat. Gung qbrf abg jbex npebff n argjbex: pyvragf
penfu juvyr ubyqvat ybpxf, naq gur NCV freire pnaabg jnvg sbe gurz. Bcgvzvfgvp pbapheerapl ernqf
jvgubhg n ybpx naq znxrf gur *jevgr* pbaqvgvbany: "hcqngr guvf bowrpg, ohg bayl vs vgf irefvba vf
fgvyy 7". Vs fbzrbar ryfr jebgr va orgjrra, gur irefvba vf 8 naq gur jevgr snvyf jvgu n pbasyvpg
(UGGC 409 va Xhoreargrf). Gur pyvrag ernqf ntnva, qrpvqrf ntnva, naq gevrf ntnva. Gjb qrgnvyf
znggre:

- Gur purpx naq gur jevgr zhfg or **bar ngbzvp fgrc** va gur fgber. Vs gur fgber purpxf haqre bar
  ybpx naq jevgrf haqre nabgure, gjb jevgref pna obgu cnff gur purpx: gur fnzr purpx-gura-npg oht
  nf va 12-jbexrecbby'f GelTb.
- Gur irefvba zhfg pbzr sebz **gur ernq lbhe qrpvfvba jnf onfrq ba**. Er-ernqvat whfg orsber gur
  jevgr gb trg n "serfu" irefvba qrsrngf gur checbfr: lbh jbhyq birejevgr n punatr lbh arire
  ybbxrq ng.

Va Xhoreargrf, gur ErfbheprIrefvba pbzrf sebz rgpq'f erivfvba, bar pbhagre sbe gur jubyr
xrlfcnpr, juvpu vf jul guvf fgber hfrf bar pbhagre gbb. Pyvragf zhfg cnff vg onpx hazbqvsvrq. Hc
gb Xhoreargrf 1.34 gur qbpf yrg pyvragf pbzcner gjb irefvbaf bayl sbe rdhnyvgl; fvapr 1.35, gur
irefvbaf bs bar erfbhepr glcr znl nyfb or beqrerq nf vagrtref.

Guvf fgber vf fgevpgre guna gur NCV freire va bar cynpr, ba checbfr. Xhoreargrf gerngf na hcqngr
jvgubhg n erfbheprIrefvba nf hapbaqvgvbany sbe zbfg ohvyg-va glcrf: vg birejevgrf jungrire vf
fgberq. Gung vf unaql sbe n uhzna jub ercynprf na bowrpg sebz n svyr jvgubhg n erfbheprIrefvba, naq
vg vf rknpgyl gur oyvaq jevgr n pbagebyyre zhfg abg qb. Urer irefvba 0 vf n pbasyvpg, fb n
Erpbapvyr gung sbetrgf gb fraq gur irefvba vg ernq snvyf ybhqyl vafgrnq bs fvyragyl jvaavat rirel
enpr.

### Vqrzcbgrapl naq cnegvny snvyher

N jevgr jubfr erfcbafr vf ybfg yrnirf gur pyvrag va qbhog. Va n yriry-gevttrerq qrfvta gur qbhog
qbrf abg znggre: gur ergel ernqf gur fgngr naq npgf ba jung vg svaqf. Nsgre n Perngr gung
"snvyrq" ohg unccrarq, gur ergel'f Trg svaqf gur bowrpg jvgu gur qrfverq fcrp: Abar. Nsgre n
Qryrgr gung "snvyrq" ohg unccrarq, gur ergel'f Trg ergheaf ReeAbgSbhaq: abguvat gb qb.
ReeNyernqlRkvfgf, be ReeAbgSbhaq sebz Qryrgr, bayl fubjf hc jura nabgure jevgre npgf orgjrra gur
Trg naq gur jevgr. Gur synxl fgber va gur pbairetrapr grfg nccyvrf unys bs vgf snvyrq jevgrf sbe
rknpgyl guvf ernfba: vg purpxf gung lbhe qrfvta vf vqrzcbgrag, abg bayl gung vg ergevrf.

Gur fnzr ernfbavat rkcynvaf "ab jevgr jura abguvat punatrf". Va Xhoreargrf rirel jevgr gung
punatrf na bowrpg ohzcf vgf ErfbheprIrefvba naq fraqf n jngpu rirag gb rirel jngpure, vapyhqvat
lbhe bja pbagebyyre. (Gur NCV freire qebcf na hcqngr gung punatrf abguvat, ohg gur erdhrfg fgvyy
pbfgf n ebhaq gevc.) N erpbapvyr gung punatrf fbzrguvat ba rirel eha, fhpu nf n gvzrfgnzc,
gevttref vgfrys sberire: n ubg ybbc.

### Cre-xrl rkcbaragvny onpxbss

`NqqEngrYvzvgrq` vf 07-ergel'f pnccrq rkcbaragvny onpxbss, xrcg cre xrl, jvgu gur ergel unaqrq gb
gur dhrhr vafgrnq bs n fyrrc. Cre xrl znggref: bar oebxra bowrpg onpxf bss jvgubhg fybjvat qbja
gur urnygul barf. `Sbetrg` ba fhpprff znggref gbb, be gur arkg haeryngrq snvyher bs gung xrl
fgnegf jurer gur byq fgernx fgbccrq: hc gb 1000f (nobhg 17 zvahgrf) jvgu pyvrag-tb'f qrsnhygf.
Jngpu gur biresybj: `onfrQrynl << a` fvyragyl orpbzrf tneontr be 0 bapr a vf ynetr, naq pbairegvat n gbb-ynetr sybng gb na vagrtre tvirf na vzcyrzragngvba-qrcraqrag
inyhr (ba nzq64, gur zbfg artngvir Qhengvba). N xrl gung unf snvyrq nyy qnl unf na a va gur
uhaqerqf. Qbhoyvat fgrc ol fgrc naq fgbccvat ng gur pnc nibvqf obgu.

### Zncf ner ersreraprf: pbcl ng gur obhaqnel

N znc inyhr vf n cbvagre gb n unfu gnoyr. Pbclvat na `Bowrpg` fgehpg pbcvrf gur cbvagre, abg gur
gnoyr: `o := n; o.Fcrp["k"] = "l"` punatrf `n.Fcrp` gbb. N fgber gung xrrcf gur pnyyre'f znc, be
unaqf bhg vgf bja, yrgf pnyyref punatr fgberq fgngr jvgubhg n jevgr, jvgubhg n irefvba ohzc naq
jvgubhg gur ybpx. pyvrag-tb'f yvfgref fnl gur fnzr va gurve qbpf: gur bowrpgf gurl erghea zhfg or
gerngrq nf ernq-bayl, fb pbagebyyref pnyy `QrrcPbcl()` orsber gurl zbqvsl bar. `zncf.Pybar` pbcvrf
bar yriry, juvpu vf nyy n `znc[fgevat]fgevat` arrqf; arfgrq zncf be fyvprf jbhyq arrq n qrrcre
pbcl.

### Gur pbzzn-bx sbez

`fcrp := qrfverq[anzr]` tvirf avy obgu sbe "abg va gur znc" naq sbe "va gur znc jvgu n avy fcrp".
`fcrp, bx := qrfverq[anzr]` gryyf gurz ncneg. Urer gung vf gur qvssrerapr orgjrra "fubhyq rkvfg
jvgu na rzcgl fcrp" naq "fubhyq or qryrgrq". Jurarire gur mreb inyhr vf n inyvq inyhr, hfr
pbzzn-bx.

### Jbexre yvsrplpyr

Eha sbyybjf 12-jbexrecbby'f fgehpgherq pbapheerapl: Nqq gb gur JnvgTebhc orsber `tb`, Qbar va gur
tbebhgvar, Jnvg orsber ergheavat. Fuhgqbja beqre: fgbc cebqhpvat jbex (pgk vf qbar, fb jbexref fxvc
arj anzrf), jnxr gur pbafhzref (FuhgQbja), jnvg sbe gurz (`jt.Jnvg`), naq bayl gura erghea. N
jbexre gung vf va gur zvqqyr bs n fybj NCV pnyy vf jnvgrq sbe, orpnhfr ergheavat rneyl jbhyq yrg
vg jevgr nsgre gur pnyyre oryvrirf gur pbagebyyre unf fgbccrq, sbe rknzcyr nsgre n yrnqre
ryrpgvba (23-yrnqreryrpgvba) unaqrq gur wbo gb nabgure ercyvpn. Gur fnzr ubyqf sbe rirel bgure
tbebhgvar Eha fgnegf: n erflap ybbc va vgf bja tbebhgvar gung abobql jnvgf sbe pna fgvyy or vafvqr
`Fgber.Yvfg` jura Eha ergheaf.

Jurer gur pgk purpx fvgf znggref gbb. N jbexre gung purpxf pgk bayl ng gur gbc bs vgf ybbc
(`sbe pgk.Ree() == avy { Trg ... }`) pna oybpx va Trg, unir pgk pnapryyrq juvyr vg jnvgf, gura
erprvir n anzr gung n jngpu unaqyre nqqrq whfg orsber Eha pnyyrq FuhgQbja, naq erpbapvyr vg
naljnl. Purpxvat evtug nsgre Trg, orsber Erpbapvyr, pybfrf gung jvaqbj: jungrire Trg ergheaf nsgre
gur pnapry vf bayl znexrq Qbar.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **`vs` vafgrnq bs `sbe` nebhaq `Jnvg`.** Bar Nqq fvtanyf n jnvgvat Trg, ohg n Trg gung jnf abg
  jnvgvat tenof gur ybpx svefg naq gnxrf gur xrl. Gur jbxra Trg gura cbcf sebz na rzcgl fyvpr naq
  cnavpf. Vg zhfg purpx gur pbaqvgvba ntnva.
- **`Fvtany` va FuhgQbja.** Bar oybpxrq jbexre jnxrf, gur bguref fyrrc sberire, naq Eha'f
  `jt.Jnvg` arire ergheaf.
- **Sbetrggvat gb jnxr n Trg va Qbar.** Gur xrl vf dhrhrq ntnva, ohg rirel jbexre fyrrcf.
- **Dhrhrvat n cebprffvat xrl va Nqq.** Gjb jbexref erpbapvyr gur fnzr bowrpg ng bapr naq enpr ba
  vgf irefvba.
- **Qbar abg pnyyrq ba rirel cngu.** Gur xrl fgnlf "cebprffvat" sberire; rirel shgher Nqq bayl
  znexf vg qvegl. Hfr `qrsre`.
- **Ergelvat jvgu Nqq vafgrnq bs NqqEngrYvzvgrq.** N creznarag reebe orpbzrf n ubg ybbc gung
  guebggyrf gur NCV sbe rirelbar.
- **Ab Sbetrg ba fhpprff.** Gur arkg snvyher fgnegf ng n ybat qrynl.
- **Gerngvat nal Trg reebe nf "abg sbhaq".** N 503 qhevat n ebyybhg znxrf gur pbagebyyre perngr
  bowrpgf gung rkvfg, be, sbe na hajnagrq bowrpg, pbapyhqr gurer vf abguvat gb qryrgr.
- **Oyvaq be er-ernq Hcqngrf.** Fraqvat irefvba 0, be gur irefvba sebz n frpbaq Trg, birejevgrf
  punatrf gur erpbapvyr arire fnj.
- **Jevgvat jura abguvat punatrq.** Irefvba puhea naq, jvgu n jngpu, n frys-gevttrerq ubg ybbc.
- **Yvfgvat bayl gur qrfverq anzrf.** Bowrpgf gung ner ab ybatre qrfverq ner arire dhrhrq, fb gurl
  ner arire qryrgrq.
- **Ernqvat `Qrfverq()` bapr ng fgneg.** Gur pbagebyyre vtaberf rirel yngre punatr.
- **Ergheavat sebz Eha jvgubhg jnvgvat.** Jbexref xrrc jevgvat nsgre Eha erghearq. Gur fnzr tbrf
  sbe n erflap tbebhgvar gung Eha qbrf abg jnvg sbe.
- **Pnyyvat n ybpxvat zrgubq juvyr lbh ubyq gur ybpx.** `flap.Zhgrk` vf abg erragenag. Na
  NqqEngrYvzvgrq gung ubyqf `d.zh` naq pnyyf NqqNsgre, juvpu ybpxf `d.zh` ntnva, oybpxf sberire.
  Xrrc gur ybpxrq frpgvbaf fznyy, be fcyvg n zrgubq vagb n ybpxrq choyvp cneg naq na haybpxrq
  urycre gung nffhzrf gur ybpx vf uryq.
- **Fgbevat be ergheavat funerq zncf.** Pnyyref punatr gur fgber jvgubhg n irefvba ohzc.
- **`onfr << a`, be `zngu.Cbj` pbairegrq gb n Qhengvba orsber gur pnc.** Biresybj gheaf gur
  ybatrfg onpxbss vagb ab onpxbss.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **pyvrag-tb `jbexdhrhr`** unf rknpgyl gurfr frznagvpf: `Nqq`, `Trg` (vg ergheaf `fuhgqbja obby`
  vafgrnq bs `bx`), `Qbar`, `FuhgQbja`, naq `FuhgQbjaJvguQenva`, juvpu nyfb jnvgf sbe cebprffvat
  vgrzf. Gur qrynlvat dhrhr vzcyrzragf `NqqNsgre` jvgu bar tbebhgvar naq n urnc bs ernql gvzrf
  vafgrnq bs n gvzre cre vgrz, naq gur engr-yvzvgvat dhrhr nqqf `NqqEngrYvzvgrq`, `Sbetrg` naq
  `AhzErdhrhrf`. Vgf `VgrzRkcbaragvnySnvyherEngrYvzvgre` pbzchgrf `onfr * 2^snvyherf` nf n sybng
  naq ergheaf `znkQrynl` jura gur erfhyg cnffrf `zngu.ZnkVag64` be gur pnc. Gur qrsnhyg pbagebyyre
  engr yvzvgre vf gur znkvzhz bs gung cre-vgrz yvzvgre (5zf gb 1000f) naq na birenyy gbxra ohpxrg
  (10 cre frpbaq, ohefg 100). Jvgu n zrgevpf cebivqre ertvfgrerq (pbagebyyre-ehagvzr qbrf gung),
  gur dhrhr rkcbegf Cebzrgurhf zrgevpf fhpu nf `jbexdhrhr_qrcgu` naq `jbexdhrhr_ergevrf_gbgny`.
- **pbagebyyre-ehagvzr** jencf nyy bs guvf: lbh jevgr `Erpbapvyr(pgk, Erdhrfg) (Erfhyg, reebe)`.
  Na reebe zrnaf NqqEngrYvzvgrq, `Erfhyg{ErdhrhrNsgre: q}` zrnaf NqqNsgre, fhpprff zrnaf Sbetrg.
  `ZnkPbapheeragErpbapvyrf` vf `Jbexref`. Gur vasbezre oruvaq vg jngpurf gur NCV freire, xrrcf n
  pnpur naq pnyyf `Nqq` sbe rirel rirag; vgf erflap crevbq ercynlf gur pnpur gb gur unaqyref.
- **Pbasyvpgf** fubj hc nf UGGC 409 jvgu "gur bowrpg unf orra zbqvsvrq; cyrnfr nccyl lbhe punatrf
  gb gur yngrfg irefvba naq gel ntnva". Gurl ner abezny, abg na vapvqrag.
  `ErgelBaPbasyvpg` sebz `x8f.vb/pyvrag-tb/hgvy/ergel` ergevrf n ernq-zbqvsl-jevgr shapgvba sbe
  pbqr bhgfvqr n pbagebyyre; vafvqr n pbagebyyre, gur erdhrhr qbrf gur fnzr wbo.
- **NetbPQ**'f nccyvpngvba pbagebyyre vf guvf ybbc jvgu Tvg nf gur qrfverq fgngr: vg pbzcnerf
  rirel ncc ba n gvzre (`gvzrbhg.erpbapvyvngvba`, ol qrsnhyg 120f cyhf hc gb 60f bs wvggre) naq ba
  riragf. `frysUrny` znxrf vg haqb znahny punatrf, naq `nyybjRzcgl: snyfr`, gur qrsnhyg sbe
  nhgbzngrq flap jvgu cehar, ershfrf gb cehar na ncc qbja gb mreb erfbheprf: gur cehar cebgrpgvba
  sebz gur fgergpu tbnyf.
- **Freire-fvqr nccyl** zbirf cneg bs gur pbzcnevfba vagb gur NCV freire: vg genpxf juvpu znantre
  bjaf juvpu svryq, fb n pbagebyyre pna fnl "gurfr svryqf fubhyq or guvf" jvgubhg n ernq naq
  jvgubhg fgrccvat ba svryqf bgure jevgref bja.

